Z||000000||fieroshop||01-19-2001||02:47 AM||||This is mainly for those that have ordered parts from me at the Fiero Shop. <BR>I had the flu for the first couple of weeks in Jan. and then this past weekend I ended in ICU at the VA hospital with a small heart attack. <BR>I am back at the shop and things are starting to catch up. Please bare with me as I try to get your orders out.<P>------------------<BR> <BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fieroshop_sig_1.gif"> ||||reg||9
