Z||000010||Sage||01-19-2001||08:38 PM||||George:<P>I haven't ordered any parts, but I remember how quick you responded when I needed technical help, and how helpful you are to everyone.  Just wanted to say that nothing is more important than your health.<P>Don't stress yourself out trying to "catch up on business", the stress is not worth it.<P>I know anyone waiting on anything will understand and tell you the same thing, take it easy!<P>My wife had to have quad bypass surgery 3 years ago, and I had to tell her the same thing, relax, slow down and don't over-react to anything.  Stressing yourself out over material things doesn't get anything more accomplished than just taking things in stride.<P>Simply put, slow down, relax and take time to smell the roses!<P>Take care and let us know how you are doing.<P>Have a good one!<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> ||||reg||1
