Z||000015||Motorhead||01-20-2001||01:20 PM||||Funny how as you get older the "BIG STUFF" doesn't seem quite so big when compared to your health!  <BR>Played basketball with my son today and it 'bout killed me!  Where did the time go?  Just "yesterday" I was running 5 miles a day, now I'm doing good just to shoot a few hoops.  That's OK though, I'm WISER now. LOL!<BR>Perspective is everything! In my mind I haven't grown up yet. <BR>Get better soon! And thanks for your time here on the forum!<BR>Mike  <P>------------------<BR>"The one who dies with the most toys wins!"  bluewater46@hotmail.com<BR>1986 coupe<BR>1984 coupe||||reg||1
